SmolLM-135M SystemVerilog inference project

The model checkpoint, config, tokenizer JSON, and derived tokenizer/tensor tables
originate from HuggingFaceTB/SmolLM-135M (Apache License 2.0):
https://huggingface.co/HuggingFaceTB/SmolLM-135M
The checkpoint itself is not stored in this repository.

The dashboard bundles Inter and Space Grotesk from the Google Fonts project.
Each font's SIL Open Font License is included beside its font file in
 dashboard/public/fonts/.
